# SEQ > KEYS > FREE PLAY on a 303: the keys play it on every 303 screen and write nothing;
# off, the white keys are steps again; REC still writes (the factory pattern's 303A is empty)
wait 300
turn ALGO 2
expect part 2
tap SEQ
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 1
key w4 down
wait 100
key w4 up
key w0 down
wait 100
key w0 up
expect gate0.4 0
expect gate0.0 0
tap EDIT
key w4 down
wait 100
key w4 up
expect gate0.4 0
shot freeplay_edit.png
# REC with FREE PLAY on: the keys write again, from step 1
tap REC
key w4 down
wait 100
key w4 up
expect gate0.0 1
tap REC
# off: a white key turns its step on
tap SEQ
turn K1 -1
key w8 down
wait 100
key w8 up
expect gate0.8 1
